  "version": "1",
  "text": "For your New Year celebration at the restaurant, I have chosen a rich chocolate satin maxi dress as your base. Its fluid fabric and relaxed cut will keep you comfortable throughout an evening of dining and dancing, while its deep tone feels elegant against the winter light. Topped with a tailored grey blazer that adds structure and polish, and paired with tall beige suede boots to ground the look, this ensemble balances ease with sophistication. To complete the festive feel, I added a patterned crossbody bag, a green malachite stud earring pair for subtle sparkle, and a pink logo clip to catch your eye.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Leave the blazer open to let the satin dress shine at dinner, then slip it on when the restaurant gets cold or if you move outdoors."
  ],
  "wrong_photos": [],
